---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="关于我">
  <article>
    <h1>👋 关于我</h1>

    <section>
      <h2>我是谁</h2>
      <p>
        我是 IBree3，一名热爱技术的开发者。这个博客记录了我的学习笔记、项目经验和技术思考。
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>技术栈</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>前端：HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Astro</li>
        <li>后端：Go, Python, Node.js</li>
        <li>工具：Git, Docker, Linux</li>
        <li>区块链：Solidity, 公链开发</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>联系方式</h2>
      <p>
        GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/ibreez3">@ibreez3</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  article {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  ul {
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  a {
    color: #2563eb;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
